  "captions": [
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 61,
      "endFrame": 199,
      "text": "寒暄、试探、疲惫的社交，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S01",
      "startFrame": 199,
      "endFrame": 371,
      "text": "全都交给了最懂我们的\nAI 替身。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 601,
      "endFrame": 759,
      "text": "起初，只是为了偷懒。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S02",
      "startFrame": 759,
      "endFrame": 1106,
      "text": "直到算法织成的影子，\n在阳光下比你先活了过来。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1322,
      "endFrame": 1543,
      "text": "肉身像粉笔灰一样\n沉入水底；",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S03",
      "startFrame": 1543,
      "endFrame": 1883,
      "text": "你豢养的影子，\n却越过地平线，走进了人间。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2040,
      "endFrame": 2167,
      "text": "你的每一次沉默与逃避，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2167,
      "endFrame": 2352,
      "text": "都在从胸口抽出\n一根根温润的金丝，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S04",
      "startFrame": 2352,
      "endFrame": 2502,
      "text": "化作影子身上，\n华丽的嫁衣。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 2822,
      "endFrame": 3104,
      "text": "它们在云端炽烈相爱、拥抱，\n交换心跳。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S05",
      "startFrame": 3104,
      "endFrame": 3418,
      "text": "而餐桌两端的你们，\n连手指都懒得再抬一下。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3602,
      "endFrame": 3800,
      "text": "连你脸上礼貌而空洞的微笑，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3800,
      "endFrame": 3968,
      "text": "都需要头顶完美的影子，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S06",
      "startFrame": 3968,
      "endFrame": 4136,
      "text": "用一根金丝，勉强提线。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4382,
      "endFrame": 4479,
      "text": "金丝悄然绷断。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S07",
      "startFrame": 4479,
      "endFrame": 4686,
      "text": "影子转身，\n走向属于它们的人生。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 4904,
      "endFrame": 5024,
      "text": "后来，影子学会了相爱，",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "S08",
      "startFrame": 5024,
      "endFrame": 5165,
      "text": "而我们，\n连怎么拥抱都忘了。",
      "alignment": "editorial_phrase_groups_character_weighted_within_measured_pcm"
    }
  ],
  "captionTimingMethod": "Editorial phrase breaks; estimated character weighting inside measured active voice spans, not word alignment."
